1
00:00:03,212 --> 00:00:08,609
A signed-in customer manages their own details on the Account details page of their account.

2
00:00:08,609 --> 00:00:12,300
I buy for says whether they buy for Myself or for A business.

3
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,155
They edit their name, the name we call them by, their phone, and

4
00:00:16,155 --> 00:00:18,358
whether they want news and offers.

5
00:00:18,358 --> 00:00:20,782
Their email is changed on the account.

6
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:23,908
Addresses lists their address book.

7
00:00:23,908 --> 00:00:28,640
They add, edit and delete addresses the same way you do in the admin.

8
00:00:29,097 --> 00:00:34,479
With Store Credit on, Store credit shows what they have and how it changed.

9
00:00:34,479 --> 00:00:38,267
With Loyalty Points on, Rewards shows their points.

10
00:00:38,717 --> 00:00:42,673
With Referrals on, Refer a friend shows their link to share.

11
00:00:42,673 --> 00:00:47,287
A friend who opens it can get a discount, and the customer is rewarded.

